:204},{"id":"art_p9_205","t":"The following ones were easier to find. Selling high and buying low... that's the name of the game (80% of the time markets range). More often that not when location is right the RBD/DBR is also a DP.\n\n10 examples:\n\n1 - this one is interesting. first the M5 RBD holded the price then after some time price made another attempt into M1 RBR before continuing lower... as if ¨it has to hit particular spot before going lower¨","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#205","p":9,"im":["1e481a9be3e41ab23107b6e2263fef33e2534ce2","fa5dfe2a336f73c3f56bd9d975da199ca9f8b11e","43f64ac6b351df7ea959bc144224ab4411952cbc","7bdc058a91bb98bb55819c82494512a11ff4e1d8","9004da05b33007fa80d898e24f0d05ccfd1d8803","8273446a4ad017b86523e4821d5d9617e5fa6ec6","7e78ddcfeee99c9a6b23266932ce22ae0eee9460","29f216075e9cfc5bac82768c9b10dc8953513d73","721a21d9578aa7acac3725ed5e4e2e6800959705","59eb15378445cbcdbf71ed7a5fb28991f1e605ef"],"m":205},{"id":"art_p9_206","t":"few trades:\n\nUSDCAD short. closed partial.. looking to either add to short or close at TG2.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#206","p":9,"im":["5795802cb31b9544ecdfb26ec64bb4ac1b3e21e6"],"m":206},{"id":"art_p9_207","t":"GBPUSD long +3,4R\n\nGBPUSD short -0,5R (shitty analysis)","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#207","p":9,"im":["e842e9f6dc0008363f083c071be8f9f36fc06b2f"],"m":207},{"id":"art_p9_208","t":"USDCAD update.. almost 5R.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#208","p":9,"im":["d2e33994aac22eb88835fae6ca2907fec35706ae","5795802cb31b9544ecdfb26ec64bb4ac1b3e21e6"],"m":208},{"id":"art_p9_209","t":"AU1 +4,1R and AU2 +1,6R. Damn you FOMC","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#209","p":9,"im":["c1068cc96f19215cb5c617b8a05b18379992dc15"],"m":209},{"id":"art_p9_210","t":"nice","a":"naascott","d":"","n":"#210","p":9,"im":[],"fa":"قشنگه","m":210},{"id":"art_p9_211","t":"@Aswilled\n\nRight up corner...trend indicator\n\nCam you share it please?","a":"xman","d":"","n":"#211","p":9,"im":[],"m":211},{"id":"art_p9_212","t":"xman, You could not be in a better place to learn this